  "id": "ucr",
  "term": "UCR",
  "definition": "UCR stands for uric acid-to-creatinine ratio, a calculated measure based on blood uric acid and creatinine levels. In this psychiatry research context, it is treated as a composite metabolic and inflammatory indicator studied as a possible biomarker for distinguishing schizophrenia or major depressive disorder from healthy controls.",
